# Guide article patterns

## Tourist guides (default)

Use `GuideArticleShell` with slots:

- `title` — usually custom `<h1>` with `font-display`, clamp font size
- `intro` — `article-body` paragraphs in `max-w-2xl`
- `beforeComparison` / `afterComparison` — main sections
- `comparisonItems={null}` when the page has its own comparison table
- End `afterComparison` with `GuideEndCta` (`parentHref`, `parentLabel`)

Shell auto-inserts: `ESimConversionBlock`, optional `ComparisonTable`, `HotelConversionBlock`, `StartHereFunnelBlock`.

## Residents

- No `GuideArticleShell`; use `<main className="bg-cream">` + `<article className="max-w-3xl">`
- Add crosslinks via `ResidentsCrosslinks`; update `RESIDENT_GUIDE_LINKS` in that file

## SEO per page

```tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: "Short page title",
  description: "One sentence for search.",
};
```

Root layout adds `| JapanProTips` via title template.

## Publishing checklist for a new guide

1. `app/guides/<slug>/page.tsx` (or `app/residents/...`)
2. `app/sitemap.ts` — add path to `STATIC_PATHS`
3. `lib/tourist-guides.ts` — card in the right section (tourist guides)
4. Hub/search update automatically from tourist sections; verify `lib/guide-search-index.ts` if needed

## Reuse before inventing

- `Callout` (`components/editorial/Callout.tsx`) for tips/warnings
- `InlineAffiliate`, `TrackedCtaLink`, `TrackedOutboundSimLink` for links
- `EDITORIAL_COPY.trustLine` from `@/lib/editorial-copy`
